normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Quattrocento Sans',sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">• Please note that weather conditions may affect the tour experience</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
